{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/467277-strix-dread-power-create-revenant","id":467277,"title":"Strix Dread Power: Create Revenant","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-04-03T06:23:26-07:00","id":467277,"title":"Strix Dread Power: Create Revenant","content":"Something I made up for a Strix in a <i>New Wave Requiem</i> game that's nearing completion. Lemme know what y'all think:<br /> <br /> <b><u>Create Revenant</u></b><br /> <b>Minimum Shadow Potency 4</b><br /> Create Revenant targets a corpse that the Strix wishes to turn into a Revenant, and involves possessing the corpse as part of the ritual. The fresher the corpse, the better. Corpses older than a month cannot be used.<br /> <b>Cost</b>: 1 Willpower, 1 Vitae (special)<br /> <b>Dice Pool:</b> Power + Shadow Potency<br /> <b>Action: </b>Extended (5 or 10 successes), each roll takes 1 night and requires the expenditure of another Vitae<br /> The Strix imbues a corpse with the power of the Beast, and uses Vitae to animate its cold limbs. If the corpse is less than a week old, only 5 successes are required; older than that requires more Vitae and time (10 successes). If the corpse has taken any amount of Aggravated damage, it's treated as over a week old. The Strix spends the Willpower at the beginning of the process, and Vitae is spent at the beginning of each night. After all necessary successes are obtained and all Vitae is spent, the corpse becomes a Revenant, with all of the benefits implied.<br /> <b>Dramatic Failure: </b>In addition to obtaining no successes, the corpse effectively &quot;ages&quot; a week. This could double the successes required or make the corpse unusable. <b>EDIT:</b> Removed &quot;All Vitae and Willpower is lost.&quot; I figured that the aging, expended Vitae, and no successes was bad enough. Plus I didn't want to imply that the Strix had to start over.<br /> <b>Failure: </b>No successes are gained that night; the Vitae is still lost.<br /> <b>Success: </b>Successes rolled are added to the ongoing process.<br /> <b>Exceptional Success</b>: The Strix does such a good job that night that the resultant Revenant is <i>better </i>than it was in life: add a single Attribute point to any of the Revenant's Attributes.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":1923,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","user":"BigDamnHero","date":".  Changed text color. 04-03-2015, 12:01 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-03T08:58:43-07:00","id":467434,"title":"","content":"Nice! I like the story implications that maybe all Revenants are created by Strix. Even if that's not true, discovering that they could have such a power could drive a city into a paranoid frenzy about the theory.<br /> <br /> Unrelated, but would you mind changing the color of that red text? That's usually a sign of moderator action, I wouldn't want to cause confusion. Dark red would probably be fine.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Going by Willow now, or Wil for short. She/Her/Hers.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/269-charlaquin","name":"Charlaquin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar269_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10831"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-03T09:22:10-07:00","id":467474,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Charlaquin</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/467277-strix-dread-power-create-revenant?p=467434#post467434\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Nice! I like the story implications that maybe all Revenants are created by Strix. Even if that's not true, discovering that they could have such a power could drive a city into a paranoid frenzy about the theory.<br /> <br /> Unrelated, but would you mind changing the color of that red text? That's usually a sign of moderator action, I wouldn't want to cause confusion. Dark red would probably be fine.</div> </div> </div> </div>I've liked using revenants as Strix cannon fodder in my games. They're confused, easy to direct, and aren't as laborious to stat out as full-fledged vampires. Plus I can use weaker Strix in a physical form (Possess Revenant).<br /> <br /> But yeah, discovering that a Strix can just <i>make</i> Revenants would probably spook a lot of vampires, and some would probably panic as soon as Revenant sightings were reported.<br /> <br /> Overall I love using the Strix. They're an antagonist that I don't have to worry about making unrepentantly against the PCs, can use in combat against them without having to redraw political boundaries or do political fallout, and who have cool powers to mess with the PCs with.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-03T10:06:45-07:00","id":467547,"title":"","content":"Harrumph. I was rereading the Strix chapter, and the last sentence after &quot;Possess Kindred&quot; was<br /> <br /> &quot;Strix embodied in a vampire can attempt to Embrace; but without Humanity to spend, their Embraces nearly always result in revenants.&quot;<br /> <br /> Which seems like an easier/cheaper way to make revenants. And given that I've made the minimum Shadow Potency required 4, there's no reason a Strix should have this power over....not having this power. The opportunity costs alone make it worthless.<br /> <br /> Hmm....","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-03T10:25:29-07:00","id":467561,"title":"","content":"It does let them frame vampires for the deed though. Hop in a corpse, get bit, raise it as a revenant. Boom, vamp in hot water.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-03T10:34:01-07:00","id":467567,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elfive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/467277-strix-dread-power-create-revenant?p=467561#post467561\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It does let them frame vampires for the deed though. Hop in a corpse, get bit, raise it as a revenant. Boom, vamp in hot water.</div> </div> </div> </div>Huh, true. It's a bit roundabout, but one of the things that I like about Strix is that they don't have to make sense and they exist almost exclusively to screw with vampires.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-03T12:10:00-07:00","id":467720,"title":"","content":"So page 94, in the paragraph above &quot;Anomalies&quot;, says that &quot;being responsible for a revenant's creation is a breaking point for a Kindred with Humanity 2 or more.&quot;<br /> <br /> Which made me curious about something: How would you handle a breaking point for something a character wasn't responsible for, but <i>believed</i> they were?<br /> <br /> In this case, being framed for creating a revenant. Say they fail the breaking point roll, but later find out that they were framed: Do you give the character a chance to make it back up with a roll somehow, or do you just let it go and say, &quot;Spend XP to get it back&quot;?<br /> <br /> I think I'm inclined to go with the latter. Seems more in-theme for Vampire, plus sometimes finding out that you didn't do something that you've been stressed about doesn't always help.<br /> <br /> But if you did allow for &quot;making up&quot; Breaking Points due to mistakes, how would you handle it?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-03T12:32:28-07:00","id":467754,"title":"","content":"I'd handle it as a breaking point. Humanity isn't about some kind of metaphysical external force turning you into a Draugr, it's internal. If your character thinks they're responsible, it'll affect them.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-03T12:34:29-07:00","id":467758,"title":"","content":"Right, I'm on board with that. I meant how would you handle them finding out after the fact that they <i>weren't </i>responsible for something they thought they did?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-03T14:02:46-07:00","id":467852,"title":"","content":"They'll probably be pretty cheesed off about it, but if you felt less Human before as a consequence of it, it's not gonna flip a switch and bring you closer to Humanity as &quot;recompense&quot; you know? The damage is already done.<br /> <br /> If I thought I killed someone and was consequently traumatized, and someone tells me this after I've suffered for god knows how long on account of my guilt and other effects, knowing the truth won't magically unfuck my head, or make the PTSD/whateverelse just go away. Could aggravate the problems really.<br /> <br /> With Kindred, I could see it making them very angry to be falsely accused. Then they go after whoever's fault it is. Hell, it might even wind up getting them <i>another </i>breaking point in the process of exacting retribution, should they feel the need. They'll lose even more Humanity, and hopefully, it'll make for a real cool story.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I am no longer participating in the community. Please do not contact me about my previous work.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/159-leetsepeak","name":"Leetsepeak","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-09T15:38:19-07:00","id":474979,"title":"","content":"Do Revenants have Blood Sympathy to their sort-of-sire? If so, it'd be pretty easy to know whether you were responsible or not.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1692-maina","name":"Maina","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1692_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"724"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-09T18:29:20-07:00","id":475179,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Maina</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/467277-strix-dread-power-create-revenant?p=474979#post474979\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do Revenants have Blood Sympathy to their sort-of-sire? If so, it'd be pretty easy to know whether you were responsible or not.</div> </div> </div> </div>They in fact have extra Blood Sympathy to their regnants. The sidebar on page 94 says that they get a +5 die bonus to Blood Sympathy checks to their sire, and that city authorities often use them as &quot;bloodhounds&quot; to find the one responsible.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T06:58:11-07:00","id":475766,"title":"","content":"On the other hand, a revenant created by a strix in this manner shouldn't have a blood tie to <i>anyone, </i>and will not know what one feels like to tell for sure. That could make things more confusing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3166-elfive","name":"Elfive","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3166_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"8226"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-04-10T07:25:09-07:00","id":475801,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Elfive</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/467277-strix-dread-power-create-revenant?p=475766#post475766\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">On the other hand, a revenant created by a strix in this manner shouldn't have a blood tie to <i>anyone, </i>and will not know what one feels like to tell for sure. That could make things more confusing.</div> </div> </div> </div>True! Kindred don't exactly have thorough census ability. Sure, the Sanctified Prince can be like, &quot;Everybody who doesn't want to incur my wrath, come to the <i>sanctum vitae</i> to be tested&quot;, but unless she's ruling with an iron fist the Carthians, Crones, and Dragons probably won't bother to show up.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;<a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/werewolf-the-forsaken/127887-doing-first-tongue-translations?p=484226#post484226\" target=\"_blank\">Nihhina kalekal-zidu kal masun, kal manudanadu. Nihhina kalekal-zidu nukal shaghu-desasudu \u2014 nihhina kalekal-zidu kal innu-desasudu udhkal samm</a>.&quot; Arthur Ashe<br /> She/her, contributing writer for <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/363404/Scion-Pride-2021\" target=\"_blank\">Scion: Pride 2021</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1923-bigdamnhero","name":"BigDamnHero","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1923_4.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1263"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}